+ ****************************************************************************/
+
+/**
+ * mvx_v4l2_session_construct() - Construct v4l2 session object.
+ * @vsession:    Pointer to a session object.
+ * @ctx:    Pointer to an external interface object.
+ *
+ * Return: 0 on success, else error code.
